---- MODULE concat ----
EXTENDS Naturals, Sequences, TLAPS
THEOREM ASSUME NEW S, NEW s \in Seq(S), NEW t \in Seq(S) PROVE Len(s \o t) = Len(s) + Len(t)
  BY SMT
====

